# Anchored to the context root: the repo's own notes/specs tree, not
# smart-qdrant-mcp-server/smart_qdrant_mcp/resources/docs/, which the MCP docs resources
# read at runtime and must ship in the image.
/docs
**/benchmark*
middleware-qdrant-manager/data/*
middleware-qdrant-manager/frontend/node_modules/
# Repository guidance is not needed in the image build context.
README.md
AGENTS.md
